<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Parmalat started with &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Parmalat started with &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSFB initiated coverage of Italy's Parmalat Finanziaria SpA with a &quot;buy&quot; rating, with a target price of 3,200 lire, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
